### Get Assets
GET http://localhost:3000/assets


### Create Asset
POST http://localhost:3000/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "name": "Euro / US Dollar",
  "type": "FOREX"
}

### Get Asset by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/assets/3
### Get all assets
GET http://localhost:3000/assets

### Update Asset
PATCH http://localhost:3000/assets/66
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Euro / US Dollar Updated"
}

### Delete Asset
DELETE http://localhost:3000/assets/123


